Hi Jenny,

There is a more rigorous overlap measure implemented in the package, with confidence intervals and some bias correction.

https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/2041-210X.13027
https://ctmm-initiative.github.io/ctmm/reference/overlap.html
Best,
Chris

